        "heading": "Thoughtful gifts, delivered with care",
        "story": [
          "PresentBox started with a simple idea: gifting should feel as good as receiving. We hand-pick aesthetic, made-to-be-shared gifts — fresh flowers, small-batch cakes, cosy hampers and little things for the room — so you can find the right one in minutes.",
